{
  "gameDescription": {
    "gameName": "Puppy Run",
    "gameIntro": "A one-button runner. A dog rides a stack of blocks; every tap wedges a new block underneath and lifts him one unit. Walls shear off the blocks below their top edge, but anything that touches the dog ends the run — so ride high enough to clear the walls, low enough to duck the slabs, and sweep up the gold coins on the way to the finish.",
